# Transient artefacts emitted by the equivalence-test harness
# (internal/equivtest). The .txt stdout snapshots are kept under git
# because they are short, human-readable proofs; the generated Go and
# Java sources, classfiles and intermediate .tom files are bulky and
# can be re-built on demand.
reports/equiv-*/go/
reports/equiv-*/go-main/
reports/equiv-*/java-src/
reports/equiv-*/java-classes/

# Go build output
*.test
*.out
